---
args: {"decision": "LedgerDecision", "sources": "EvidencePage[]"}
returns: "PremiseLink[]"
---
Contrast the adopted resolution with the same decision under the candidate premise's negation. If independent reasons still justify the decision, the link is supporting or context. Link another decision only through an evidenced identity and dependency statement. Record a concrete changed consequence, not a tautology. Citations to inaccessible material become opaque source references; an inferred necessity remains unreviewed until explicit owner confirmation.
